SUMMARY:Understanding Menopause
LOCATION:Tampa \, FL United States
DESCRIPTION:Menopause is a topic for womens health that doesnt usually get
  time in the spotlight. During this presentation\, we are going to shine t
 he light on perimenopause\, menopause\, and life after menopause. Specific
 ally\, we are going to: Define menopause and what causes it Learn what hap
 pens in the body during menopause Understand some of the Common symptoms a
 nd symptom management Discuss some health considerations for post-menopaus
 al women Identify some of the resources you have available Register: Under
 standing Menopause (https:events.teams.microsoft.comevent13bb8f37-b045-48c
 e-8f7b-83fe895b7ec0db05faca-c82a-4b9d-b9c5-0f64b6755421?sourcecopyLinkLega
